  - m_Id: 1016655000000000
    m_Localized: 'Test: Open Inventory'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1016655000000001
    m_Localized: Open the inventory once, then claim the quest from the GM quest
      page.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1016655000000002
    m_Localized: Open the inventory once
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1016655000000003
    m_Localized: 'Test: Pick Up Items'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1016655000000004
    m_Localized: Pick up any three items. The quest turns in automatically.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1016655000000005
    m_Localized: Pick up any 3 items
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1016655000000006
    m_Localized: 'Test: Own Sticks'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1016655000000007
    m_Localized: Own five wooden sticks in the bag or hotbar to test a state-based
      objective.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1016655000000008
    m_Localized: Own 5 wooden sticks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1016655000000009
    m_Localized: 'Test: Craft and Build'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1016655000000010
    m_Localized: Craft a chipped stone tool, then place any building to test stage
      progression.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1016655000000011
    m_Localized: Craft one chipped stone tool
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1016655000000012
    m_Localized: Place any building once
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
