  - m_Id: 12591148785721344
    m_Localized: Stone Mortar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12591148827664384
    m_Localized: Each strike turns one rice grain into one rice. Choose Place on
      Ground in the held mortar's panel, then interact with it or pack it up. All
      ingredients and products are retained.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12624922206527488
    m_Localized: A placed clay jar. Interact to drink dirty or boiled water, empty
      it, pour from a held jar or pack it up. Water amount, quality and heating progress
      stay with the container.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12624922244276224
    m_Localized: A placed stone mortar. Interact to process one recipe per strike.
      All ingredients and products are retained when packing up or placing it again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
