  - m_Id: 23082859181891584
    m_Localized: GM Heavy-Lift Test Engine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23082859458715648
    m_Localized: GM Heavy-Lift Test Engine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23082859458715649
    m_Localized: GM test ship engine providing 600000 N of thrust. Uses real hydrogen-oxygen
      fuel and electricity to lift heavy test cargo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23082859458715650
    m_Localized: GM test ship engine providing 600000 N of thrust. Uses real hydrogen-oxygen
      fuel and electricity to lift heavy test cargo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23082859458715651
    m_Localized: Creative Power Source
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23082859458715652
    m_Localized: Creative Power Source
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23082859458715653
    m_Localized: Creative mode power source. Connect to a copper wire in the same cell
      for unlimited power on demand without fuel or stored charge. Voltage compatibility
      and wire capacity limits still apply.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23082859458715654
    m_Localized: Creative mode power source. Connect to a copper wire in the same cell
      for unlimited power on demand without fuel or stored charge. Voltage compatibility
      and wire capacity limits still apply.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23082859458715655
    m_Localized: "Induction Stove"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23082859458715656
    m_Localized: "Induction Stove"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23082859458715657
    m_Localized: "Automatically heats materials with electricity. 3 input slots with 300 kg / 300 L capacity, 2 output slots and a 150% heating coefficient. Default target 2000 C; adjustable from 20 to 3500 C at 120 V. Power rises linearly with the target: 600 W at 1000 C, 1200 W at 2000 C and 2100 W at 3500 C. Materials transform at their own temperature and cool naturally after lowering the target or losing power."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23082859458715658
    m_Localized: "Automatically heats materials with electricity. 3 input slots with 300 kg / 300 L capacity, 2 output slots and a 150% heating coefficient. Default target 2000 C; adjustable from 20 to 3500 C at 120 V. Power rises linearly with the target: 600 W at 1000 C, 1200 W at 2000 C and 2100 W at 3500 C. Materials transform at their own temperature and cool naturally after lowering the target or losing power."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23082859458715659
    m_Localized: "Space Elevator Terminal"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23082859458715660
    m_Localized: "Space Elevator"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23082859458715661
    m_Localized: "Connects the ground to an expandable fixed space station. Transports cargo and players both ways. Paired terminals cannot be dismantled. This prototype does not consume power."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23082859458715662
    m_Localized: "Connects the ground to an expandable fixed space station. Transports cargo and players both ways. Paired terminals cannot be dismantled. This prototype does not consume power."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23082859458715663
    m_Localized: "Wooden Shield"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23082859458715664
    m_Localized: "A shield of lashed wooden slats. In hand: tap primary attack to bash (+5 defense during the action), or hold to guard (+10 defense, half movement speed). In the offhand slot: use Parry (Q by default) for a brief +10 defense window. Equipping alone grants no passive defense."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
