    m_Localized: Leather Strap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27603267485732864
    m_Localized: Cut from tanned leather. Replaces rope one for one. Using straps
      for all required binding materials increases current and maximum durability
      by 30%. One strap can also reinforce a tool. Both methods share one strap bonus,
      independently stackable with adhesive and nail reinforcement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
