  - m_Id: 27608689814835200
    m_Localized: Copper Needle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27608690188128256
    m_Localized: A metal sewing tool forged on an anvil. Has 100 durability and loses
      1 for each completed item. Breaks at zero; stacked needles are used one at
      a time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27608690188128257
    m_Localized: Iron Needle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27608690188128258
    m_Localized: A metal sewing tool forged on an anvil. Has 200 durability and loses
      1 for each completed item. Breaks at zero; stacked needles are used one at
      a time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27608690188128259
    m_Localized: Iron Anvil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27608690188128260
    m_Localized: Iron Anvil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27608690188128261
    m_Localized: Place this anvil to forge metal plates or sewing needles. Has 1,000
      durability and loses 1 per item produced. When worn out, drops 5 wrought iron
      ingots and all contents.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27608690188128262
    m_Localized: Place this anvil to forge metal plates or sewing needles. Has 1,000
      durability and loses 1 per item produced. When worn out, drops 5 wrought iron
      ingots and all contents.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27608690188128263
    m_Localized: Place this anvil to forge metal plates or sewing needles. Each strike
      adds 0.7 work seconds. Has 500 durability and loses 1 per item produced. When
      worn out, drops half its recipe materials and all contents.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27608690188128264
    m_Localized: Place on the ground to forge items. Has 500 durability and loses
      1 per item produced. When worn out, drops 5 copper ingots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27608690188128265
    m_Localized: "Tungsten Ingot"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27608690188128266
    m_Localized: "A dense, heat-resistant metal ingot smelted from tungsten ore at 3422 C or above. Can be stacked and stored as an advanced material."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27608690188128267
    m_Localized: "Tungsten Ore"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27608690188128268
    m_Localized: "Rare tungsten-bearing ore from underground. Set an induction stove target to at least 3422 C to smelt 2 ore into 1 tungsten ingot."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27608690188128269
    m_Localized: "Tungsten Deposit"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27608690188128270
    m_Localized: "A rare tungsten vein in underground caves, harder than iron ore. Mine with a pickaxe to obtain tungsten ore."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
