  - m_Id: 27615045322402003
    m_Localized: "Railway Track"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27615045322402004
    m_Localized: "A ground railway tile that connects into straights and curves. Minecarts follow it; it has no mechanical power connection."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27615045322402005
    m_Localized: "Railway Track"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27615045322402006
    m_Localized: "A ground railway tile that connects into straights and curves. Minecarts follow it; it has no mechanical power connection."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27615045322402007
    m_Localized: "Minecart"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27615045322402008
    m_Localized: "Place on ground or rails and walk into the cart to push it. Ground resistance is very high; rails guide movement. One rider per cart; F boards or dismounts. Two engine slots on the left, 18 cargo slots on the right. Put water vessels and fuel in cargo and install an engine to drive with WASD. Engines only move slowly on ground. Connect nearby carts to share power."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27615045322402009
    m_Localized: "Minecart"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27615045322402010
    m_Localized: "Place on ground or rails and walk into the cart to push it. Ground resistance is very high; rails guide movement. One rider per cart; F boards or dismounts. Two engine slots on the left, 18 cargo slots on the right. Put water vessels and fuel in cargo and install an engine to drive with WASD. Engines only move slowly on ground. Connect nearby carts to share power."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27615045322402011
    m_Localized: "Steam Engine"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27615045322402012
    m_Localized: "A removable steam power module. Right-click while held to configure the switch and output level. Install in an engine slot; it draws water from vessels and fuel in train cargo to power the entire train."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
