      a cell with wires and automatically connects to adjacent pipes and matching
      equipment ports. Silver-blue pipes and teal collars identify fluid lines; pipes
      can be stacked in the inventory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27915474610196498
    m_Localized: A fluid valve. Use its configuration panel to inspect actual gas
      and liquid contents, direction, and power. Empty equipment starts under vacuum.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27915474610196499
    m_Localized: A fluid valve. Use its configuration panel to inspect actual gas
      and liquid contents, direction, and power. Empty equipment starts under vacuum.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27915474610196500
    m_Localized: "Releases gas or liquid from a pipe. When it points toward an adjacent
      furnace and actually vents oxygen, it raises the maximum combustion temperature
      by 500\xB0C. Only the higher bonus from this or mechanical bellows applies."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
