    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27915474610196504
    m_Localized: A one-cell iron gas tank block. Adjacent blocks of the same material
      connect into a shared tank, adding 100 L per cell. Dismantling releases that
      cell's share of gas and liquid and returns an empty block. Empty tanks start
      under vacuum and exchange heat with the surrounding environment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27915474610196505
