  - m_Id: 27915474618585103
    m_Localized: Heats the surrounding area while powered and stops when power is
      lost. Can warm nearby gas tanks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27915474618585104
    m_Localized: A fluid filter. Use its configuration panel to inspect actual gas
      and liquid contents, direction, and power. Empty equipment starts under vacuum.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27915474618585105
    m_Localized: A fluid filter. Use its configuration panel to inspect actual gas
      and liquid contents, direction, and power. Empty equipment starts under vacuum.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27915474618585106
    m_Localized: Electrolyzes water when powered. Fresh water produces a hydrogen-oxygen
      mix; brine and seawater produce a hydrogen-chlorine mix. It has one water inlet
      and one gas outlet. Alkali stays in a byproduct chamber that can be emptied
      with a handheld liquid container; solid impurities are collected in the residue
      slot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27915474618585107
    m_Localized: Electrolyzes water when powered. Fresh water produces a hydrogen-oxygen
      mix; brine and seawater produce a hydrogen-chlorine mix. It has one water inlet
      and one gas outlet. Alkali stays in a byproduct chamber that can be emptied
      with a handheld liquid container; solid impurities are collected in the residue
      slot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27915474618585108
    m_Localized: A hydrogen engine with separate input pipes for hydrogen and oxygen.
      It consumes them at a 2:1 molar ratio to produce mechanical power and returns
      water through a liquid output pipe. It stops if hydrogen or oxygen is missing,
      there is no valid load, or the recovered water tank is full.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27915474618585109
    m_Localized: A hydrogen engine with separate input pipes for hydrogen and oxygen.
      It consumes them at a 2:1 molar ratio to produce mechanical power and returns
      water through a liquid output pipe. It stops if hydrogen or oxygen is missing,
      there is no valid load, or the recovered water tank is full.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27915474618585110
    m_Localized: Solid impurities separated by filtration or electrolysis.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27915474618585111
    m_Localized: Starts under vacuum; fill it with filling equipment. Gas and liquid
      share its capacity. Overpressure causes ongoing damage, and when wall durability
      reaches zero the tank explodes at its holder's position.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27915474618585112
    m_Localized: Starts under vacuum; fill it with filling equipment. Gas and liquid
      share its capacity. Overpressure causes ongoing damage, and when wall durability
      reaches zero the tank explodes at its holder's position.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27915474618585113
    m_Localized: "Outer spacesuit armor; choose any clothing to wear underneath.
      Expands the safe body-temperature range and improves cold and heat resistance.
      Wearing the full spacesuit\u2014helmet, suit, pants, boots, and gloves\u2014with
      the helmet on also expands the safe pressure range. Replace the oxygen tank
      in the suit's configuration panel."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27915474618585114
    m_Localized: Outer spacesuit armor; choose any clothing to wear underneath. Expands
      the safe body-temperature range and improves cold and heat resistance. Wearing
      the full suit with the helmet on also expands the safe pressure range. The
      configuration panel lets you replace oxygen and propulsion tanks. Landing impacts
      consume the suit's durability; impacts beyond its protection can still injure
      the player.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27915474618585115
    m_Localized: "Outer spacesuit armor; choose any clothing to wear underneath.
