  - m_Id: 27915474618585118
    m_Localized: A placeable wooden trough that holds 64 units of mixed liquid and
      can be dismantled. It holds no solid items. Each draw removes one liquid in
      its actual proportion; even less than one unit can be poured or pumped out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27915474618585119
    m_Localized: A placed trough that holds 64 units of mixed liquid and can connect
      to a liquid pump or outlet. Dismantling it preserves the liquid mix, temperature,
      pending output batches, and durability.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27915474618585120
    m_Localized: Four-way connections form an independent hull. A complete floor
      supports crew and protects them from hazardous tiles below.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
