  - m_Id: 27915474622779396
    m_Localized: A one-cell airtight block engine that must be installed on the outer
      edge of a hull. Its nozzle must face outside with a clear path ahead. The nozzle
      points down and the air inlet points up by default; press R while placing to
      rotate it. Connect the inlet to hydrogen and oxygen tanks with pipes, and connect
      a wire.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
