  - m_Id: 27915474622779406
    m_Localized: Four separate growing slots can grow different non-tree crops at
      once. Crops grow when connected to power and real irrigation water; buckets
      and pipes share the same water tank. Fertilizer is optional, and growth pauses
      without power or water. Interact to harvest, change seeds, or add water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27915474631168000
    m_Localized: A four-slot planter that can be placed on the ground or a ship floor.
      It needs power and water. Dismantling it preserves all seeds, crop growth,
      water, and harvests.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
